{"id":"0c5e56070c342728","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-nt.md","title":"原始递归语言中的数论 NT","display":"df-nt — 原始递归语言中的数论 NT","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-nt","aliases":["18-df-nt"],"display":"df-nt — 原始递归语言中的数论 NT","depends_on":["[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]","[[18-df-peano-arithmetic]]","[[18-df-provable]]","[[18-df-first-order-calculus]]","[[18-df-symbol-alphabet]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"§7.2; Theorem 7.2.1","source_pages":"106–107","source_pdf_pages":"116–117","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked","local_revision":"2026-10-14","local_review_scope":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification","prior_revision_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-nt"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-nt</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nt — 原始递归语言中的数论 NT"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fe2ed372063cc94a\" href=\"?note=fe2ed372063cc94a\" title=\"18-df-peano-arithmetic\">18-df-peano-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9cea4880793901f3\" href=\"?note=9cea4880793901f3\" title=\"18-df-provable\">18-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"592fd98020c21e43\" href=\"?note=592fd98020c21e43\" title=\"18-df-first-order-calculus\">18-df-first-order-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca728af2af9b9d11\" href=\"?note=ca728af2af9b9d11\" title=\"18-df-symbol-alphabet\">18-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§7.2; Theorem 7.2.1"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"106–107"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"116–117"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-machine-checked"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"local_review_scope","html":"definitions, syntax, explicit dependencies; not proof-assistant verification"},{"key":"prior_revision_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7ddb1b71680edcd2\" href=\"?note=7ddb1b71680edcd2\" title=\"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language\">18-df-arithmetic-tait-language</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{FV}_0\">\\(\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{FV}_0\\)</span>、自由集参数与原始递归函数符号，单变量捕获避免代入记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F[x:=t]\">\\(F[x:=t]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}\\)</span> 取该上游的数变量全称闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S,\\mathsf C^n_k,\\mathsf P^n_k,\\mathsf{Sub},\\mathsf{Rec}\">\\(\\mathsf S,\\mathsf C^n_k,\\mathsf P^n_k,\\mathsf{Sub},\\mathsf{Rec}\\)</span> 分别表示 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,C^n_k,P^n_k,\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Rec}\">\\(S,C^n_k,P^n_k,\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Rec}\\)</span> 构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_n=\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n\">\\(\\mathcal R_n=\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n\\)</span>。所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元组按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,\\ldots,n-1\">\\(0,\\ldots,n-1\\)</span> 索引；构造符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P^n_k\">\\(\\mathsf P^n_k\\)</span> 的书内指标仍取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\\le k\\le n\">\\(1\\le k\\le n\\)</span>，所以其输出坐标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k-1\">\\(k-1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sub}(g,\\vec h)\">\\(\\mathsf{Sub}(g,\\vec h)\\)</span> 指按元组次序传入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}\">\\(h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>有限推导使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"592fd98020c21e43\" href=\"?note=592fd98020c21e43\" title=\"18-df-first-order-calculus\">18-df-first-order-calculus</a>，先经下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 把 Tait 公式送入一阶公式树，不混同两种语法。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg F:=\\sim F\">\\(\\neg F:=\\sim F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\to G:=(\\sim F\\lor G)\">\\(F\\to G:=(\\sim F\\lor G)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\leftrightarrow G:=((F\\to G)\\land(G\\to F))\">\\(F\\leftrightarrow G:=((F\\to G)\\land(G\\to F))\\)</span> 是 Tait 构造的缩写。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathrm{PR}},\\mathrm{IDEN},\\mathrm{Fresh}_{\\mathrm N},\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathrm{PR}},\\mathrm{IDEN},\\mathrm{Fresh}_{\\mathrm N},\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}\\)</span> 均由下式定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\">\\(F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&lt;\\omega\">\\(n&lt;\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec v,\\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\mathcal V^n\">\\(\\vec v,\\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\mathcal V^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\">\\(\\vec t\\)</span> 为等长数项列。元组首尾分解仅在非空时使用。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak z,j_n(f),r(X)\">\\(\\mathfrak z,j_n(f),r(X)\\)</span> 是分别代表数零、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathcal R_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathcal R_n\\)</span> 和自由一元关系参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathcal X\">\\(X\\in\\mathcal X\\)</span> 的全新符号；所有这些符号分量两两不交，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_n,r\">\\(j_n,r\\)</span> 单射，且与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 不交。符号可取带互斥标签的有序对。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}(\\mathcal X)\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}(\\mathcal X)\\)</span> 是下式的签名；变量枚举沿用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span>。后续在一阶项中直接写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,0,X\">\\(f,0,X\\)</span> 时，分别表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j_n(f),\\mathfrak z,r(X)\">\\(j_n(f),\\mathfrak z,r(X)\\)</span>，而 Tait 项仍沿用其原构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_0\">\\(E_0\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 递归地给出这一区别；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 仅保留没有自由集合参数的翻译公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}F_i\">\\(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}F_i\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}\">\\(\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}\\)</span> 展开，空合取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=0\">\\(0=0\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IDEN}\">\\(\\mathrm{IDEN}\\)</span> 中三个独立闭公理的显示变量固定取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x_0,y=x_1,z=x_2\">\\(x=x_0,y=x_1,z=x_2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{NT}^{-}\\)</span> 的两个独立闭公理固定取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x_0,y=x_1\">\\(x=x_0,y=x_1\\)</span>。索引集合中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v,x,y\">\\(\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v,x,y\\)</span> 仍各按该集合式自身的量化域及新鲜性条件取值。这些固定占位符不改变带参数的公理模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathcal V,\\{\\mathfrak z\\}\\cup j_0[\\mathcal R_0],(j_n[\\mathcal R_n])_{n\\ge1},(\\varnothing)_{n\\ge1},(x_i)_{i&lt;\\omega}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}(\\mathcal X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ext}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}};\\varnothing,(\\varnothing)_{n\\ge1},(R_n^*)_{n\\ge1}),\\\\\nR_1^*&amp;\\coloneqq r[\\mathcal X],\\qquad R_n^*\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\ge2),\\\\\nE_0(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{var}(x),\\quad E_0(0)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{con}(\\mathfrak z),\\\\\nE_0(f())&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{con}(j_0(f))\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal R_0),\\\\\nE_0(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{app}(j_n(f),\\langle E_0(t_i):i&lt;n\\rangle)\\quad(n\\ge1),\\\\\nE(s=t)&amp;\\coloneqq(E_0(s)\\doteq E_0(t)),\\quad E(s\\ne t)\\coloneqq\\neg(E_0(s)\\doteq E_0(t)),\\\\\nE(t\\in X)&amp;\\coloneqq r(X)(E_0(t)),\\quad E(t\\notin X)\\coloneqq\\neg r(X)(E_0(t)),\\\\\nE(F\\circ G)&amp;\\coloneqq E(F)\\circ E(G)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}),\\\\\nE(QxF)&amp;\\coloneqq QxE(F)\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq(0=0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\langle F\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec G)&amp;\\coloneqq F\\land\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\vec G),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}F_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\langle F_i:i&lt;n\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathcal V,\\{\\mathfrak z\\}\\cup j_0[\\mathcal R_0],(j_n[\\mathcal R_n])_{n\\ge1},(\\varnothing)_{n\\ge1},(x_i)_{i&lt;\\omega}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}(\\mathcal X)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ext}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}};\\varnothing,(\\varnothing)_{n\\ge1},(R_n^*)_{n\\ge1}),\\\\\nR_1^*&amp;\\coloneqq r[\\mathcal X],\\qquad R_n^*\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\ge2),\\\\\nE_0(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{var}(x),\\quad E_0(0)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{con}(\\mathfrak z),\\\\\nE_0(f())&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{con}(j_0(f))\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal R_0),\\\\\nE_0(f(\\vec t))&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{app}(j_n(f),\\langle E_0(t_i):i&lt;n\\rangle)\\quad(n\\ge1),\\\\\nE(s=t)&amp;\\coloneqq(E_0(s)\\doteq E_0(t)),\\quad E(s\\ne t)\\coloneqq\\neg(E_0(s)\\doteq E_0(t)),\\\\\nE(t\\in X)&amp;\\coloneqq r(X)(E_0(t)),\\quad E(t\\notin X)\\coloneqq\\neg r(X)(E_0(t)),\\\\\nE(F\\circ G)&amp;\\coloneqq E(F)\\circ E(G)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}),\\\\\nE(QxF)&amp;\\coloneqq QxE(F)\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq(0=0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\langle F\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec G)&amp;\\coloneqq F\\land\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\vec G),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}F_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\langle F_i:i&lt;n\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F[t/x]\\coloneqq F[x:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F[t/x]\\coloneqq F[x:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F,\\langle\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F,\\langle\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F,\\langle v\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec w,\\langle t\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec u)\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F[v:=t],\\vec w,\\vec u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F,\\langle v\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec w,\\langle t\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec u)\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F[v:=t],\\vec w,\\vec u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F[\\vec t/\\vec v]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F,\\vec v,\\vec t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F[\\vec t/\\vec v]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F,\\vec v,\\vec t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Fresh}_{\\mathrm N}(n,F,\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v\\in\\mathcal V^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j&lt;n\\;(i\\ne j\\to(x_i\\ne x_j\\land y_i\\ne y_j\\land v_i\\ne v_j))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y))\\cap\n(\\mathrm{FV}_0(F)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec v))=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Fresh}_{\\mathrm N}(n,F,\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v\\in\\mathcal V^n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i,j&lt;n\\;(i\\ne j\\to(x_i\\ne x_j\\land y_i\\ne y_j\\land v_i\\ne v_j))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y))\\cap\n(\\mathrm{FV}_0(F)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec v))=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf C^n_k(\\vec x)=\\overline k)\\mid n,k&lt;\\omega,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf P^n_k(\\vec x)=x_{k-1})\\mid1\\le k\\le n&lt;\\omega,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf{Sub}(g,\\vec h)(\\vec x)=g(h_0(\\vec x),\\ldots,h_{m-1}(\\vec x)))\\mid\n1\\le m&lt;\\omega,\\ n&lt;\\omega,\\ g\\in\\mathcal R_m,\\ \\vec h\\in\\mathcal R_n^m,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf{Rec}(g,h)(0,\\vec x)=g(\\vec x))\\mid\nn&lt;\\omega,\\ g\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\ h\\in\\mathcal R_{n+2},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf{Rec}(g,h)(\\mathsf S y,\\vec x)=h(y,\\mathsf{Rec}(g,h)(y,\\vec x),\\vec x))\\mid\nn&lt;\\omega,\\ g\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\ h\\in\\mathcal R_{n+2},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n,\\ y\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf C^n_k(\\vec x)=\\overline k)\\mid n,k&lt;\\omega,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf P^n_k(\\vec x)=x_{k-1})\\mid1\\le k\\le n&lt;\\omega,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf{Sub}(g,\\vec h)(\\vec x)=g(h_0(\\vec x),\\ldots,h_{m-1}(\\vec x)))\\mid\n1\\le m&lt;\\omega,\\ n&lt;\\omega,\\ g\\in\\mathcal R_m,\\ \\vec h\\in\\mathcal R_n^m,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf{Rec}(g,h)(0,\\vec x)=g(\\vec x))\\mid\nn&lt;\\omega,\\ g\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\ h\\in\\mathcal R_{n+2},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf{Rec}(g,h)(\\mathsf S y,\\vec x)=h(y,\\mathsf{Rec}(g,h)(y,\\vec x),\\vec x))\\mid\nn&lt;\\omega,\\ g\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\ h\\in\\mathcal R_{n+2},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n,\\ y\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IDEN}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\forall x\\;(x=x),\\\n\\forall x\\forall y\\;(x=y\\to y=x),\\\n\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\;(x=y\\land y=z\\to x=z)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}x_i=y_i\\to f(\\vec x)=f(\\vec y))\\mid\nn&lt;\\omega,\\ f\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\ \\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}x_i=y_i\\to(F[\\vec x/\\vec v]\\to F[\\vec y/\\vec v]))\\mid\nn&lt;\\omega,\\ F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v\\in\\mathcal V^n,\n\\mathrm{Fresh}_{\\mathrm N}(n,F,\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IDEN}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\forall x\\;(x=x),\\\n\\forall x\\forall y\\;(x=y\\to y=x),\\\n\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\;(x=y\\land y=z\\to x=z)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}x_i=y_i\\to f(\\vec x)=f(\\vec y))\\mid\nn&lt;\\omega,\\ f\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\ \\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;n}x_i=y_i\\to(F[\\vec x/\\vec v]\\to F[\\vec y/\\vec v]))\\mid\nn&lt;\\omega,\\ F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v\\in\\mathcal V^n,\n\\mathrm{Fresh}_{\\mathrm N}(n,F,\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}^{-}\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x\\;(0\\ne\\mathsf Sx),\\\n\\forall x\\forall y\\;(\\mathsf Sx=\\mathsf Sy\\to x=y)\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\cup\\mathrm{IDEN}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NT}^{-}\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x\\;(0\\ne\\mathsf Sx),\\\n\\forall x\\forall y\\;(\\mathsf Sx=\\mathsf Sy\\to x=y)\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\cup\\mathrm{IDEN}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NT}^{-}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}((F[0/x]\\land\\forall x\\;(F\\to F[\\mathsf Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\;F)\n\\mid F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ x\\in\\mathcal V\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NT}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NT}^{-}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}((F[0/x]\\land\\forall x\\;(F\\to F[\\mathsf Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\;F)\n\\mid F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ x\\in\\mathcal V\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\n\\{E(A):A\\in\\mathrm{NT}^{-},\\ \\mathrm{FV}_1(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\n\\{E(A):A\\in\\mathrm{NT}^{-},\\ \\mathrm{FV}_1(A)=\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NT}\\vdash F\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\\n\\{E(A):A\\in\\mathrm{NT}\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}(\\mathcal X)}E(F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{NT}\\vdash F\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\\n\\{E(A):A\\in\\mathrm{NT}\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}(\\mathcal X)}E(F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 §7.2 的公理与 Theorem 7.2.1 的有限公理使用。五个函数方程族分别显式绑定全部元数、函数项和变量元组；与原书的一基元组展示只作坐标改名。Rec 递归坐标在第一位。公式替换用逐项单变量代入；Fresh_N 使输出变量与后续待替换变量不交，避免顺序干扰，单变量接口自行处理束缚变量改名。每个有限自由变量集外有足够多新变量，所以这里的带 fresh 公式等号模式与原书一般模式经变量改名相对应。</p>\n<p>自由集变量仅为参数，不作一阶量化；NT⊢F 是元层有限推导，不是 NT 的对象语言谓词。NT⁻ 是去掉归纳模式后的本地接口；更换为扩展语言时，IDEN 的公式替换族与 IND 都须相应实例化。旧目录只有 PA 与含糊 PA∞，无这个具体 NT 公理接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-arithmetic-tait-language","status":"resolved","id":"7ddb1b71680edcd2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-peano-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"fe2ed372063cc94a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-peano-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"9cea4880793901f3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-first-order-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"592fd98020c21e43","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","