F$、$F\\to G:=(\\sim F\\lor G)$、$F\\leftrightarrow G:=((F\\to G)\\land(G\\to F))$ 是 Tait 构造的缩写。$\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathrm{PR}},\\mathrm{IDEN},\\mathrm{Fresh}_{\\mathrm N},\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}$ 均由下式定义。$F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}$，$n<\\omega$；$\\vec v,\\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\mathcal V^n$，$\\vec t$ 为等长数项列。元组首尾分解仅在非空时使用。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\mathcal V,\\mathrm{FV}_0","display":false},{"tex":"F[x:=t]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S,\\mathsf C^n_k,\\mathsf P^n_k,\\mathsf{Sub},\\mathsf{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"S,C^n_k,P^n_k,\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{Rec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_n=\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"0,\\ldots,n-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf P^n_k","display":false},{"tex":"1\\le k\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"k-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sub}(g,\\vec h)","display":false},{"tex":"h_0,\\ldots,h_{m-1}","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg F:=\\sim F","display":false},{"tex":"F\\to G:=(\\sim F\\lor G)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\leftrightarrow G:=((F\\to G)\\land(G\\to F))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathrm{PR}},\\mathrm{IDEN},\\mathrm{Fresh}_{\\mathrm N},\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}","display":false},{"tex":"n<\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec v,\\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\mathcal V^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak z,j_n(f),r(X)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathcal R_n","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathcal X","display":false},{"tex":"j_n,r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}(\\mathcal X)","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"f,0,X","display":false},{"tex":"j_n(f),\\mathfrak z,r(X)","display":false},{"tex":"E_0","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_{i<n}F_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}","display":false},{"tex":"0=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IDEN}","display":false},{"tex":"x=x_0,y=x_1,z=x_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"x=x_0,y=x_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v,x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}&\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathcal V,\\{\\mathfrak z\\}\\cup j_0[\\mathcal R_0],(j_n[\\mathcal R_n])_{n\\ge1},(\\varnothing)_{n\\ge1},(x_i)_{i<\\omega}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}(\\mathcal X)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Ext}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}};\\varnothing,(\\varnothing)_{n\\ge1},(R_n^*)_{n\\ge1}),\\\\\nR_1^*&\\coloneqq r[\\mathcal X],\\qquad R_n^*\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(n\\ge2),\\\\\nE_0(x)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{var}(x),\\quad E_0(0)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{con}(\\mathfrak z),\\\\\nE_0(f())&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{con}(j_0(f))\\quad(f\\in\\mathcal R_0),\\\\\nE_0(f(\\vec t))&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{app}(j_n(f),\\langle E_0(t_i):i<n\\rangle)\\quad(n\\ge1),\\\\\nE(s=t)&\\coloneqq(E_0(s)\\doteq E_0(t)),\\quad E(s\\ne t)\\coloneqq\\neg(E_0(s)\\doteq E_0(t)),\\\\\nE(t\\in X)&\\coloneqq r(X)(E_0(t)),\\quad E(t\\notin X)\\coloneqq\\neg r(X)(E_0(t)),\\\\\nE(F\\circ G)&\\coloneqq E(F)\\circ E(G)\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}),\\\\\nE(QxF)&\\coloneqq QxE(F)\\quad(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\langle\\rangle)&\\coloneqq(0=0),\\\\\n\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\langle F\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec G)&\\coloneqq F\\land\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\vec G),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{i<n}F_i&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{And}_{\\mathrm N}(\\langle F_i:i<n\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"F[t/x]\\coloneqq F[x:=t].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F,\\langle\\rangle,\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq F.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F,\\langle v\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec w,\\langle t\\rangle{}^\\frown\\vec u)\n\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F[v:=t],\\vec w,\\vec u).","display":true},{"tex":"F[\\vec t/\\vec v]\\coloneqq\\mathrm{SubVec}_{\\mathrm N}(F,\\vec v,\\vec t).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Fresh}_{\\mathrm N}(n,F,\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v\\in\\mathcal V^n\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i,j<n\\;(i\\ne j\\to(x_i\\ne x_j\\land y_i\\ne y_j\\land v_i\\ne v_j))\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&\\land(\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec y))\\cap\n(\\mathrm{FV}_0(F)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec v))=\\varnothing.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\coloneqq{}&\n\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf C^n_k(\\vec x)=\\overline k)\\mid n,k<\\omega,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf P^n_k(\\vec x)=x_{k-1})\\mid1\\le k\\le n<\\omega,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf{Sub}(g,\\vec h)(\\vec x)=g(h_0(\\vec x),\\ldots,h_{m-1}(\\vec x)))\\mid\n1\\le m<\\omega,\\ n<\\omega,\\ g\\in\\mathcal R_m,\\ \\vec h\\in\\mathcal R_n^m,\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf{Rec}(g,h)(0,\\vec x)=g(\\vec x))\\mid\nn<\\omega,\\ g\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\ h\\in\\mathcal R_{n+2},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\mathsf{Rec}(g,h)(\\mathsf S y,\\vec x)=h(y,\\mathsf{Rec}(g,h)(y,\\vec x),\\vec x))\\mid\nn<\\omega,\\ g\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\ h\\in\\mathcal R_{n+2},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathcal V^n,\\ y\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IDEN}\\coloneqq{}&\\{\\forall x\\;(x=x),\\\n\\forall x\\forall y\\;(x=y\\to y=x),\\\n\\forall x\\forall y\\forall z\\;(x=y\\land y=z\\to x=z)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\bigwedge_{i<n}x_i=y_i\\to f(\\vec x)=f(\\vec y))\\mid\nn<\\omega,\\ f\\in\\mathcal R_n,\\ \\vec x,\\vec y\\in\\mathcal V^n\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}(\\bigwedge_{i<n}x_i=y_i\\to(F[\\vec x/\\vec v]\\to F[\\vec y/\\vec v]))\\mid\nn<\\omega,\\ F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ \\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v\\in\\mathcal V^n,\n\\mathrm{Fresh}_{\\mathrm N}(n,F,\\vec x,\\vec y,\\vec v)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NT}^{-}\\coloneqq\\{\\forall x\\;(0\\ne\\mathsf Sx),\\\n\\forall x\\forall y\\;(\\mathsf Sx=\\mathsf Sy\\to x=y)\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Def}_{\\mathrm{PR}}\\cup\\mathrm{IDEN}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NT}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{NT}^{-}\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}((F[0/x]\\land\\forall x\\;(F\\to F[\\mathsf Sx/x]))\\to\\forall x\\;F)\n\\mid F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}},\\ x\\in\\mathcal V\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\n\\{E(A):A\\in\\mathrm{NT}^{-},\\ \\mathrm{FV}_1(A)=\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NT}\\vdash F\\ \\longleftrightarrow\\\n\\{E(A):A\\in\\mathrm{NT}\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}(\\mathcal X)}E(F).","display":true}],"bytes":8129,"backlinks":[{"id":"6d3242aa1837d0b9","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"源公式 $F\\in\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{NT}}$、项、$\\mathcal X=\\{X_i:i<\\omega\\}$ 与翻译 $E$ 见 [[18-df-nt]]。目标语言 $L_{\\mathrm{PA}}$ 及 $\\mathcal L_\\in$ 分别见 [[18-df-peano-arithmetic]]、[[18-df-kripke-platek-set-theory]]；其一元关系扩张 $L_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{\\mathcal X}$ 在下式定义，关系符号为全新的 $r(X_i)$。$\\mathsf G_f(\\vec t,y)$ 是 $f\\in\\mathrm{PRTerm}_n$ 的 PA 图公式构造，$\\vec t$ 为 $n$ 个 PA 项，$y$ 也是 PA 项；$\\mathsf V(t,y)$ 是源数项 $t$ 的值公式。$\\mathsf J$ 把 PA 公式送入集合论公式，源数变量 $x_i$ 送到 $w_{2i}$，关系参数 $X_i$ 送到集合变量 $w_{2i+1}$。所有出现于右侧的定义缩写均展开为所声明目标签名的有限公式树，不是给对象理论加入新的原始函数或谓词。"},{"id":"5a148e8fcfeed406","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_2$ 是原始递归算术的双类语法：数变量集合 $V_0=\\{v_i^0\\mid i<\\omega\\}$ 与集合变量集合 $V_1=\\{v_i^1\\mid i<\\omega\\}$ 不交且各枚举无重复。数项集合 $\\mathrm{Term}_2$ 在下式分阶段构造，函数符号集 $\\mathcal R_n$ 取 [[18-df-nt]]。等号仅作用于数项，$t\\in X$ 的第二参数为 $X\\in V_1$。项与公式的构造子使用互斥标签的有限树编码；变量类及其量词通过 $V_0,V_1$ 区分。$\\mathsf{Fml}_2$ 由下式的有限阶段构造定义，不依赖另行给定的语法树全集。"},{"id":"ee9a93363bcae359","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 与 $\\mathrm{NT}^{-}_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 是 [[18-df-nt]] 的原始递归算术语言与无归纳算术公理。"},{"id":"fd63116e7f220f4d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 是 [[18-df-nt]] 的原始递归一阶算术语言；$\\mathcal L$ 是包含它的任意一阶关系扩展语言。语法按 [[18-df-formula]]，替换与自由变量分别按 [[18-df-substitution-formula]]、[[18-df-free-variable]]；此处公式集合是元理论的集合，公式构造子不是对象语言中的集合运算。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-97","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-nt]]"},{"id":"956bd27fcd234fa7","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 是 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]] 的伪 Π¹₁ 句，$\\mathrm{NT}$ 见 [[18-df-nt]]，$D^\\alpha_\\rho$ 为 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]] 的具体半形式演算。"},{"id":"a44f2e4245074d4a","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NT}$ 是 [[18-df-nt]] 的一阶理论，$\\vdash$ 是该节点约定的普通有限一阶可证明性；$\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 为 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]] 的无自由数变量公式集，允许自由集参数。$\\neg F$ 是普通语言否定，翻译到算术 Tait 语言时采用对偶。"},{"id":"251b8cab45b0242d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F\\in\\Psi_{\\mathrm{NT}}$ 是 [[18-df-arithmetic-tait-language]] 的伪 Π¹₁ 句，$\\mathrm{NT}$ 见 [[18-df-nt]]，$D^\\alpha_\\rho$ 为 [[18-df-semiformal-derivability]] 的具体半形式演算。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-nt]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-nt]]"}],"outgoing":["7ddb1b71680edcd2","f04544345afa1f92","fe2ed372063cc94a","9cea4880793901f3","592fd98020c21e43","ca728af2af9b9d11"]